{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-36409","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56152","text":"Forge Semantic IR v1 — FROZEN"}]},{"id":"blk-36410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56153","text":"*Status: "},{"id":"spn-56154","marks":["bold"],"text":"FROZEN"},{"id":"spn-56155","text":" (2026-07-21), per GPT-5.6 ruling. Profile: "},{"id":"spn-56156","marks":["code"],"text":"forge.world.core.v1"},{"id":"spn-56157","text":" — the "},{"id":"spn-56158","marks":["bold"],"text":"deterministic-circuit-world"},{"id":"spn-56159","text":" profile. This is the sanctioned lowering target for WRL Core 0.1.1. WRL surface text NEVER lowers directly to interaction-calculus text; it lowers to this IR, which lowers to TRVM facts/films/reductions.*"}]},{"id":"blk-36411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56160","marks":["bold"],"text":"Scope statement (normative)."},{"id":"spn-56161","text":" IR v1 defines static deterministic signal graphs containing the five built-in roles, persistent numeric/pose state, bounded ADMIT claim state, and the two grounded topology relations. It does "},{"id":"spn-56162","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-56163","text":" define mailboxes, arbitrary actor behavior, dynamic topology, fragments, capabilities, supervision, or distributed settlement. Any construct outside this scope MUST produce a clear unsupported-feature diagnostic, never a speculative lowering."}]},{"id":"blk-36412","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56164","text":"Predecessor: "},{"id":"spn-56165","marks":["code"],"text":"FORGE_SEMANTIC_IR_v1_MEASURE.md"},{"id":"spn-56166","text":" (the pre-freeze measure). Frozen core: "},{"id":"spn-56167","marks":["code"],"text":"WRL_CORE_0.1.md"},{"id":"spn-56168","text":" (rev 0.1.1). This freeze resolves decisions D1–D5 as ruled."}]},{"id":"blk-36413","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56169","text":"0. Three layers (D3)"}]},{"id":"blk-36414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56170","text":"IR v1 is three artifacts with three lifetimes. They are never conflated."}]},{"id":"blk-36415","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"ArtifactIR (static)  +  RuntimeState (persistent)  +  EpochInput (per-epoch)\n    → RuntimeState'  +  Observables"},{"id":"blk-36416","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56171","marks":["bold"],"text":"Static artifact"},{"id":"spn-56172","text":" — durable topology + role configs + policy references + schema references. Content-addressed."}]}],"id":"blk-36417","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56173","marks":["bold"],"text":"Persistent runtime state"},{"id":"spn-56174","text":" — world state, claim facts, receipts, capacity-fault latches, clock/pose/rotor/fault state. Threads across epochs."}]}],"id":"blk-36419","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56175","marks":["bold"],"text":"Epoch input"},{"id":"spn-56176","text":" — the incoming claim batch (later: external / effect-wall observations)."}]}],"id":"blk-36421","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56177","text":"Claim facts and receipts are "},{"id":"spn-56178","marks":["bold"],"text":"top-level runtime state"},{"id":"spn-56179","text":", not hidden inside a special actor. ADMIT's "},{"id":"spn-56180","marks":["italic"],"text":"policy identity"},{"id":"spn-56181","text":" is static; its "},{"id":"spn-56182","marks":["italic"],"text":"facts and receipts"},{"id":"spn-56183","text":" are runtime state; the incoming "},{"id":"spn-56184","marks":["italic"],"text":"claim batch"},{"id":"spn-56185","text":" is epoch input."}]},{"id":"blk-36424","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56186","text":"1. Node envelope + five built-in roles (D1)"}]},{"id":"blk-36425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56187","text":"One structural node envelope is frozen:"}]},{"id":"blk-36426","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Node {\n    object_id\n    role                 ; one of the five closed role IDs below\n    static_config        ; role-specific frozen config\n    state_schema_ref     ; semantic state signature (see §3)\n    ports                ; frozen per-role port signature\n}"},{"id":"blk-36427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56188","text":"The entire executable v1 role registry is these five (closed):"}]},{"id":"blk-36428","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56189","text":"PulserDecl"}]},{"id":"blk-36429","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36431","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56190","marks":["bold"],"text":"static_config:"},{"id":"spn-56191","text":" clock mode "},{"id":"spn-56192","marks":["code"],"text":"(\"periodic\", period, phase)"},{"id":"spn-56193","text":" | "},{"id":"spn-56194","marks":["code"],"text":"(\"once\", epoch)"},{"id":"spn-56195","text":" (period ≥ 1, 0 ≤ phase < period, period < 1e9; epoch in [0,1e6))."}]}],"id":"blk-36430","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56196","marks":["bold"],"text":"ports:"},{"id":"spn-56197","text":" out "},{"id":"spn-56198","marks":["code"],"text":"sig_out"},{"id":"spn-56199","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-36432","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36435","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56200","marks":["bold"],"text":"state:"},{"id":"spn-56201","text":" clock state (see §3)."}]}],"id":"blk-36434","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36437","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56202","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant:"},{"id":"spn-56203","text":" fires deterministically by clock mode; never data-dependent."}]}],"id":"blk-36436","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36438","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56204","text":"RelayDecl"}]},{"id":"blk-36439","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56205","marks":["bold"],"text":"static_config:"},{"id":"spn-56206","text":" none."}]}],"id":"blk-36440","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56207","marks":["bold"],"text":"ports:"},{"id":"spn-56208","text":" out "},{"id":"spn-56209","marks":["code"],"text":"sig_out"},{"id":"spn-56210","text":"; in "},{"id":"spn-56211","marks":["code"],"text":"sig_in"},{"id":"spn-56212","text":" (or-merge of incoming wires)."}]}],"id":"blk-36442","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56213","marks":["bold"],"text":"state:"},{"id":"spn-56214","text":" "},{"id":"spn-56215","marks":["code"],"text":"cur_out"},{"id":"spn-56216","text":", "},{"id":"spn-56217","marks":["code"],"text":"next_out"},{"id":"spn-56218","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-36444","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56219","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant:"},{"id":"spn-56220","text":" "},{"id":"spn-56221","marks":["code"],"text":"next_out = OR(incoming .nxt)"},{"id":"spn-56222","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-56223","marks":["code"],"text":"cur_out' = next_out"},{"id":"spn-56224","text":" at commit."}]}],"id":"blk-36446","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36448","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56225","text":"DoorDecl"}]},{"id":"blk-36449","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36451","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56226","marks":["bold"],"text":"static_config:"},{"id":"spn-56227","text":" none."}]}],"id":"blk-36450","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36453","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56228","marks":["bold"],"text":"ports:"},{"id":"spn-56229","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-56230","marks":["code"],"text":"sig_in"},{"id":"spn-56231","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-36452","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56232","marks":["bold"],"text":"state:"},{"id":"spn-56233","text":" "},{"id":"spn-56234","marks":["code"],"text":"open"},{"id":"spn-56235","text":", "},{"id":"spn-56236","marks":["code"],"text":"next_open"},{"id":"spn-56237","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-36454","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56238","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant:"},{"id":"spn-56239","text":" "},{"id":"spn-56240","marks":["code"],"text":"open' = next_open"},{"id":"spn-56241","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-56242","marks":["code"],"text":"next_open' = incoming wire "},{"id":"spn-56243","text":".nxt`."}]}],"id":"blk-36456","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36458","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56244","text":"SpinnerDecl"}]},{"id":"blk-36459","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56245","marks":["bold"],"text":"static_config:"},{"id":"spn-56246","text":" lane geometry "},{"id":"spn-56247","marks":["code"],"text":"(w, n)"},{"id":"spn-56248","text":", initial "},{"id":"spn-56249","marks":["code"],"text":"rotor4"},{"id":"spn-56250","text":", "},{"id":"spn-56251","marks":["code"],"text":"configurable"},{"id":"spn-56252","text":" permission (fixed | configurable)."}]}],"id":"blk-36460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56253","marks":["bold"],"text":"ports:"},{"id":"spn-56254","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-56255","marks":["code"],"text":"sig_in"},{"id":"spn-56256","text":" (exactly one); out "},{"id":"spn-56257","marks":["code"],"text":"socket"},{"id":"spn-56258","text":" (exactly one)."}]}],"id":"blk-36462","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56259","marks":["bold"],"text":"state:"},{"id":"spn-56260","text":" "},{"id":"spn-56261","marks":["code"],"text":"rotor"},{"id":"spn-56262","text":" (Q-fixed lanes, runtime STATE)."}]}],"id":"blk-36464","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56263","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant:"},{"id":"spn-56264","text":" exactly one sig-in + exactly one socket; fixed spinners REJECT runtime rotor writes (typed error); configurable accept "},{"id":"spn-56265","marks":["code"],"text":"SetRotor"},{"id":"spn-56266","text":" at COMMIT."}]}],"id":"blk-36466","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36468","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56267","text":"OrbDecl"}]},{"id":"blk-36469","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56268","marks":["bold"],"text":"static_config:"},{"id":"spn-56269","text":" none."}]}],"id":"blk-36470","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56270","marks":["bold"],"text":"ports:"},{"id":"spn-56271","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-56272","marks":["code"],"text":"pose"},{"id":"spn-56273","text":" (via socket)."}]}],"id":"blk-36472","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56274","marks":["bold"],"text":"state:"},{"id":"spn-56275","text":" "},{"id":"spn-56276","marks":["code"],"text":"pose4"},{"id":"spn-56277","text":", sticky "},{"id":"spn-56278","marks":["code"],"text":"numeric_fault"},{"id":"spn-56279","text":" bit."}]}],"id":"blk-36474","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56280","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant:"},{"id":"spn-56281","text":" controller exclusivity (≤ 1 socket); "},{"id":"spn-56282","marks":["code"],"text":"numeric_fault' = fault_base OR current_overflow"},{"id":"spn-56283","text":" where "},{"id":"spn-56284","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_base = 0 if ResetFault else old"},{"id":"spn-56285","text":" (a reset cannot hide a same-epoch overflow)."}]}],"id":"blk-36476","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36478","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56286","marks":["bold"],"text":"Frozen:"},{"id":"spn-56287","text":" node envelope, the five role IDs, their config/port/state signatures, their invariants. "},{"id":"spn-56288","marks":["bold"],"text":"Not frozen:"},{"id":"spn-56289","text":" user-defined behaviors, mailboxes, supervision, generic behavior tables, dynamic role loading, the physical IC encoding of each state. New built-in roles are additive "},{"id":"spn-56290","marks":["bold"],"text":"v1.x"},{"id":"spn-56291","text":"; a general actor-behavior system stays Experimental."}]},{"id":"blk-36479","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56292","text":"2. Edge vocabulary (D2)"}]},{"id":"blk-36480","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56293","text":"Exactly two "},{"id":"spn-56294","marks":["bold"],"text":"structural topology edges"},{"id":"spn-56295","text":" are frozen:"}]},{"id":"blk-36481","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SignalWireDecl    { src.sig_out → dst.sig_in }   ; dst ∈ {Door, Relay, Spinner}\nSocketControlDecl { spinner.socket → orb.pose }"},{"id":"blk-36482","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56296","text":"Legal pairs: "},{"id":"spn-56297","marks":["code"],"text":"(sig_out, sig_in)"},{"id":"spn-56298","text":", "},{"id":"spn-56299","marks":["code"],"text":"(socket, pose)"},{"id":"spn-56300","text":". Any other edge variant MUST fail validation."}]},{"id":"blk-36483","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56301","marks":["bold"],"text":"Graph edges are not transition classes."},{"id":"spn-56302","text":" These are NOT structural edge kinds in v1:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-36485","spans":[{"id":"spn-56303","text":"WRL texture"}]},{"id":"blk-36486","spans":[{"id":"spn-56304","text":"IR v1 status"}]}],"id":"blk-36484","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-36487","spans":[{"id":"spn-56305","text":"Solid "},{"id":"spn-56306","marks":["code"],"text":"--"}]},{"id":"blk-36488","spans":[{"id":"spn-56307","text":"executable through "},{"id":"spn-56308","marks":["code"],"text":"SignalWire"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36489","spans":[{"id":"spn-56309","text":"Async "},{"id":"spn-56310","marks":["code"],"text":"~~"}]},{"id":"blk-36490","spans":[{"id":"spn-56311","text":"reserved in WRL, "},{"id":"spn-56312","marks":["bold"],"text":"absent"},{"id":"spn-56313","text":" from IR v1 (no placeholder node)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36491","spans":[{"id":"spn-56314","text":"Verified "},{"id":"spn-56315","marks":["code"],"text":"=="}]},{"id":"blk-36492","spans":[{"id":"spn-56316","text":"acceptance machinery grounded; route construct "},{"id":"spn-56317","marks":["bold"],"text":"absent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36493","spans":[{"id":"spn-56318","text":"Fault "},{"id":"spn-56319","marks":["code"],"text":"!!"}]},{"id":"blk-36494","spans":[{"id":"spn-56320","text":"fault state grounded; route/supervision construct "},{"id":"spn-56321","marks":["bold"],"text":"absent"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-36495","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56322","text":"A numeric-fault latch is "},{"id":"spn-56323","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-56324","text":" the lowering of a "},{"id":"spn-56325","marks":["code"],"text":"!!fault!!>"},{"id":"spn-56326","text":" route; an acceptance receipt is "},{"id":"spn-56327","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-56328","text":" a complete lowering of a "},{"id":"spn-56329","marks":["code"],"text":"==verified==>"},{"id":"spn-56330","text":" route. Reserved WRL syntax needs no placeholder canonical IR node."}]},{"id":"blk-36496","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56331","text":"3. State schema — semantic vs backend (D4)"}]},{"id":"blk-36497","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56332","text":"IR v1 freezes "},{"id":"spn-56333","marks":["bold"],"text":"semantic signatures"},{"id":"spn-56334","text":"; it excludes "},{"id":"spn-56335","marks":["bold"],"text":"backend encodings"},{"id":"spn-56336","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56337","marks":["bold"],"text":"Semantic (in the artifact or a referenced policy/schema):"},{"id":"spn-56338","text":" signedness; lane width; fractional bits; numeric-policy identity; saturation behavior; rounding behavior; sticky-fault behavior; fixed-vs-configurable permission; fact/receipt capacity (when exhaustion is observable); rotor & pose lane counts; claim & receipt field meanings."}]},{"id":"blk-36499","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56339","marks":["bold"],"text":"Backend (excluded — belongs to a lowering profile):"},{"id":"spn-56340","text":" Scott encoding; tuple nesting; DUP labels; one-hot vs binary clock counter; packed-word layout; IC variable names; native struct padding; CUDA memory layout."}]},{"id":"blk-36500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56341","marks":["bold"],"text":"Identity split (frozen):"}]},{"id":"blk-36501","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SemanticArtifactID = hash( canonical Forge IR + semantic policy references )\nBackendArtifactID  = hash( SemanticArtifactID + lowering profile + compiler hash + backend representation )"},{"id":"blk-36502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56342","text":"Changing one-hot → binary changes the "},{"id":"spn-56343","marks":["bold"],"text":"BackendArtifactID"},{"id":"spn-56344","text":" only (not the world identity or WorldFrame). Changing Q32.32 → Q16.16 changes the "},{"id":"spn-56345","marks":["bold"],"text":"SemanticArtifactID"},{"id":"spn-56346","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36503","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56347","text":"4. Frozen top-level forms"}]},{"id":"blk-36504","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"ForgeSemanticArtifactV1 {\n    ir_version\n    profile_id                 ; \"forge.world.core.v1\" (deterministic-circuit-world)\n    semantic_policies {\n        rulepack_id\n        numeric_policy_ids\n        admit_policy_id        ; e.g. admit_candidate_min_firstreceipt_v1\n        film_schema_id\n    }\n    schemas {\n        runtime_state_schema\n        epoch_input_schema\n        observable_schema\n    }\n    objects: [ PulserDecl, RelayDecl, DoorDecl, SpinnerDecl, OrbDecl ]\n    edges:   [ SignalWireDecl, SocketControlDecl ]\n    initial_state\n}\n\nRuntimeStateV1 {\n    epoch\n    clock_states\n    signal_states\n    door_states\n    relay_states\n    spinner_rotors\n    orb_poses\n    numeric_faults\n    claim_facts\n    acceptance_receipts\n    capacity_faults\n}\n\nEpochInputV1 { claim_batch }          ; ClaimBatch of SetRotor|ResetFault envelopes\n\nEpochResultV1 { runtime_state, world_frame, ledger_entries }"},{"id":"blk-36505","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56348","text":"5. Transition law (frozen)"}]},{"id":"blk-36506","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56349","text":"Per epoch the transition is the WRL Core 0.1.1 cycle:"}]},{"id":"blk-36507","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"OBSERVE → ACCEPT → MAP → COMMIT → REACT → FILM"},{"id":"blk-36508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56350","text":"For claim-free epochs OBSERVE/ACCEPT/MAP degenerate to identity but remain in the model. COMMIT applies MAP'd controls (SetRotor writes + fault resets) to owned cells; REACT runs the deterministic within-period token cascade to fixpoint and latches overflow; FILM emits the "},{"id":"spn-56351","marks":["bold"],"text":"WorldFrame"},{"id":"spn-56352","text":" (physical, Film v0.6 family) + "},{"id":"spn-56353","marks":["bold"],"text":"EventLedger"},{"id":"spn-56354","text":" entries (claim-aware, Film v0.7 family). Canonical ordering is policy-pinned (the ADMIT profile pins "},{"id":"spn-56355","marks":["code"],"text":"CandidateKey"},{"id":"spn-56356","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-36509","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56357","text":"6. Versioning (D5)"}]},{"id":"blk-36510","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56358","marks":["bold"],"text":"v1"},{"id":"spn-56359","text":" freezes on the grounded "},{"id":"spn-56360","marks":["code"],"text":"deterministic-circuit-world"},{"id":"spn-56361","text":" profile — sufficient evidence exists (multiple clock modes, randomized topologies, fan-in/out, cycles, multiple controllers, dynamic rotors, persistent multi-epoch state, claims/receipts, fault reset, pose authority, native+reference reducers). It does "},{"id":"spn-56362","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-56363","text":" claim to be the universal final Forge IR."}]}],"id":"blk-36511","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36514","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56364","marks":["bold"],"text":"v1.1"},{"id":"spn-56365","text":" — additive role/field variants when a second world family arrives."}]}],"id":"blk-36513","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56366","marks":["bold"],"text":"v1.x"},{"id":"spn-56367","text":" — additive optional feature declarations."}]}],"id":"blk-36515","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56368","marks":["bold"],"text":"v2"},{"id":"spn-56369","text":" — any change to the meaning of an existing field. A second implementation must NOT silently reinterpret v1 fields."}]}],"id":"blk-36517","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36519","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56370","text":"7. First WRL vertical slice (what the compiler supports)"}]},{"id":"blk-36520","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"WRL Core text/canvas → canonical WRL graph → Forge Semantic IR v1\n    → current Fixture adapter → TRVM compiler → ic_ref / ic32 → Film v0.7"},{"id":"blk-36521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56371","text":"Supported: Pulser, Relay, Door, Spinner, Orb; signal wires; socket control; fixed-point policy declarations; "},{"id":"spn-56372","marks":["code"],"text":"SetRotor"},{"id":"spn-56373","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-56374","marks":["code"],"text":"ResetFault"},{"id":"spn-56375","text":"; a fixed number of periods. Everything else → clear unsupported-feature diagnostic."}]},{"id":"blk-36522","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56376","text":"8. Conformance (what IR v1 does NOT define)"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-56377","text":"IR v1 defines static deterministic signal graphs containing the five built-in roles, persistent numeric pose state, bounded ADMIT claim state, and the two grounded topology relations. It does not define mailboxes, arbitrary actor behavior, dynamic topology, fragments, capabilities, supervision, or distributed settlement."}]}],"id":"blk-36523","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-36525","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-56378","text":"D1–D5 resolution"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-36527","spans":[{"id":"spn-56379","text":"Decision"}]},{"id":"blk-36528","spans":[{"id":"spn-56380","text":"Ruling (frozen)"}]}],"id":"blk-36526","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-36529","spans":[{"id":"spn-56381","text":"D1 node vocabulary"}]},{"id":"blk-36530","spans":[{"id":"spn-56382","text":"stable node envelope + five closed built-in roles"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36531","spans":[{"id":"spn-56383","text":"D2 edge vocabulary"}]},{"id":"blk-36532","spans":[{"id":"spn-56384","text":"two structural edge kinds only; async/fault/verified are transition-class reserved, not edges"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36533","spans":[{"id":"spn-56385","text":"D3 ADMIT"}]},{"id":"blk-36534","spans":[{"id":"spn-56386","text":"static policy + top-level runtime ClaimState + separate EpochInput (three layers)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36535","spans":[{"id":"spn-56387","text":"D4 state schema"}]},{"id":"blk-36536","spans":[{"id":"spn-56388","text":"semantic signature frozen in artifact; physical representation excluded to backend profile; Semantic/Backend artifact-ID split"}]}],[{"id":"blk-36537","spans":[{"id":"spn-56389","text":"D5 freeze timing"}]},{"id":"blk-36538","spans":[{"id":"spn-56390","text":"freeze now as restricted "},{"id":"spn-56391","marks":["code"],"text":"deterministic-circuit-world"},{"id":"spn-56392","text":" profile; v1.1 additive, v2 semantic"}]}]]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraud2ngbkm7giclclrxdcrcs3bitvbagovecsxpqpqvr55ecycqthq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}